msgstr "我们已经检查了客户端响应、存储的订单，以及当事件无法发布时的情况。但有些故障发生在建立连接之前，或者发生在应用程序写入本地文件时。您也可以测试这些故障："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "*The customer requests an invoice, but the disk is full. Does your service report the failure and recover when space is available?* `faults.directory(path).diskFull()` makes supported Java file writes under that directory fail with “No space left on device”, without filling the disk."
msgstr "*客户请求开具发票，但磁盘已满。您的服务会报告此故障，并在有可用空间时进行恢复吗？* `faults.directory(path).diskFull()` 会使该目录下受支持的 Java 文件写入操作因“设备空间已满”而失败，同时不会真正填满磁盘。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "*Inventory is healthy, but its hostname no longer resolves. Does checkout handle that failure too?* `faults.target(InventoryClient.class).unresolvable()` makes new connection attempts fail with `UnknownHostException`. Drop existing connections first so the next request encounters the fault."
msgstr "*Inventory 状态良好，但其主机名无法解析。Checkout 是否也会处理这种故障？调用* `faults.target(InventoryClient.class).unresolvable()` 会导致新的连接尝试抛出 `UnknownHostException` 异常。请先断开现有连接，以便后续请求能遇到该故障。"

