#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A test can apply a fault to the wrong dependency and still get its expected response.\n"
"The extension guards against this: if no connection goes through the target proxy while the fault is active, it fails the test and identifies the target to investigate.\n"
"That guard complements your assertions; you still need to check the outcome that matters, such as one charge, a bounded wait, or recovery."
msgstr "测试可能会将故障施加到错误的依赖项上，却仍能得到预期的响应。 该扩展可防范这种情况：如果在故障活跃期间没有连接通过目标代理，则测试将失败，并标识出需要调查的目标。该保护机制是对您断言的补充；您仍需检查关键结果，例如单次计费、有限等待或恢复情况。"

